{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And the hands are the hands of Esau.</b> There is no doubt that the skins were prepared in such a way that their hair resembled human hair, for indeed there is a great difference between human hair and goat hair if it is not extensively worked by craft. And behold, he testified that his hands were like the hands of Esau his brother — hairy — and with this, perhaps his sense of touch was also weakened in him, in the manner of אִם יִטְעַם עַבְדְּךָ עוֹד אֶת אֲשֶׁר אֹכַל (2 Samuel 19:36)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:59.422890724Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}